# Drop royalty-free music tracks (.mp3, .wav) here.
#
# Free sources:
#   - YouTube Audio Library:  studio.youtube.com → Audio Library  (no attribution needed)
#   - Pixabay Music:          pixabay.com/music                   (Pixabay license)
#   - Free Music Archive:     freemusicarchive.org                (per-track licenses)
#
# Keep a licenses.csv next to the tracks (track filename, source URL, license, attribution).
# assemble.py will read it and copy the relevant row into each video's provenance record.
